  "hints": [
    "Counting each value and rewriting works in two passes. Can you do one?",
    "Dutch national flag: keep three regions with pointers `low`, `mid`, `high`.",
    "low, mid, high = 0, 0, n-1\nwhile mid <= high:\n    if nums[mid] == 0: swap(low, mid); low += 1; mid += 1\n    elif nums[mid] == 1: mid += 1\n    else: swap(mid, high); high -= 1\nreturn nums",
    "Everything before `low` is 0, between `low` and `mid` is 1, after `high` is 2. Each step shrinks the unknown middle: one pass, O(1) space. Don't advance `mid` after swapping with `high`: the swapped-in value is unchecked."
  ],
  "expected_complexity": {
    "time": "O(n)",
    "space": "O(1)"
  },
